# instances.list — linked / WordPress-integrated ODR instance roots, one per line.
#
# Copy this to  app/config/instances.list  (which is gitignored — it's per-server) and list the
# ROOT directory of each linked instance (the dir that contains app/config), NOT the app dir.
#
# Used by  app/console-all  to fan a single console command out across every site:
#     app/console-all cache:clear --env=prod
#
# Blank lines and everything after a '#' are ignored.
#
# Example:
# /home/rruff/data-publisher
# /home/amcsd/data-publisher
# /home/ima/data-publisher
